# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context exclusions.
#
# This file must live at the CONTEXT ROOT. Docker does not honour per-directory
# .dockerignore files, so apps/*/.dockerignore would be silently inert — which
# is how the host's Windows node_modules ended up overwriting the image's and
# breaking every build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.brief

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

*.md
!README.md

.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
